{"type":"message","id":"cf503001","parentId":"575ed6a9","timestamp":"2026-02-18T22:00:39.866Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_1771452026908_33","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-02-18\n\n- **GitHub Backup Success**: Successfully synced the entire OpenClaw configuration and workspace (`~/.openclaw`) to the private repository `Lfantasial/openclaw-config-backup`.\n- **System Diagnosis**: Verified that while the core system is healthy, the `Memory` plugin is currently unavailable due to a missing embedding API key.\n- **Odin Inventory**: Created and saved `odin_items.md` containing detailed game item lists for Loki 7 and other sub-accounts.\n- **Design Work**: Produced a sophisticated 2026 New Year's card (\"Eternal Horizon\") after troubleshooting Korean font issues by installing `NanumGothic`.\n- **Notion Integration**: Configured Notion API access using a provided integration token. Successfully read and summarized a task database containing ITAM, DevSecOps, and CAPEX related items.\n- **Tools Updated**: Recorded the Notion integration token in `TOOLS.md` for persistent access.\n- **Notion Automation**: Created `notion_daily_brief.py` and scheduled a daily cron job (`notion-daily-briefing`) at 08:00 KST to summarize tasks from the previous 24 hours (07:00-07:00).\n- **Backup Automation**: Scheduled `daily-github-backup` to run every day at 04:00 KST, ensuring all settings and conversation logs are synced to GitHub.\n- **System Health**: Clarified that security audit warnings regarding `~/.npm-global/bin/openclaw` or `~/.openclaw/bin` are expected due to the NVM-based installation and do not indicate a real issue.\n- **Automation Refinement**: Changed the `daily-update-check` schedule from 09:00 to 06:00 KST to ensure issues can be fixed before business hours.\n- **Model Identity Correction**: Confirmed that \"Gemini 3\" (Pro/Flash) is indeed the next-generation \"agent-first\" architecture from Google, distinct from and superior to the 1.5 series, featuring Deep Think capabilities and lower latency.\n- **Security Awareness**: Identified that `openclaw.json` contains plain text secrets (Telegram bot token and gateway auth token), necessitating the strict privacy of the GitHub backup repository.\n- **Troubleshooting**: Fixed duplicated cron briefing messages by disabling redundant \"announce\" delivery modes and ensuring Hugin delivers the reports personally via isolated agent turns.\n- **Workflow Optimization**: Established a 24-hour lookback window (07:00-07:00) for Notion daily briefings to ensure complete data coverage for morning reports.\n- **Urgent Task Identified**: Noted that remediation for `CVE-2025-24813` on servers `ONEKORCRMAP002A` and `ONEKORSACAP01` is due today (Feb 18).\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1771452039864}}
